{"duration_api_ms":10767,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3147333c-82a1-44ed-ab60-5e0db06ba8da","total_cost_usd":0.0290663,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1053,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1023,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":624},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1053,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1023,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1053,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1053},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1618,"outputTokens":25,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00017430000000000004,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1023,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1053,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.028892,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":624,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":1053,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Rule 6c-11(b) gives qualifying ETFs four types of relief:**\n\n1. **Redeemability:** ETF shares are \"redeemable securities\" under Section 2(a)(32), so ETFs can operate as open-end funds while redeeming only in creation units.\n2. **Secondary-market pricing:** Shares may trade at market prices rather than NAV, with relief from Section 22(d) and Rule 22c-1.\n3. **Affiliate in-kind transactions:** Relief from Sections 17(a)(1) and (2).\n4. **Delayed redemption delivery:** Limited relief from Section 22(e)'s seven-day requirement.\n\n**Affiliate limits:** Relief covers only in-kind creations and redemptions by first-tier affiliates (affiliated *solely* by owning 5% or more, or more than 25%, of the ETF's shares) or second-tier affiliates (affiliates of those holders). It excludes affiliation through the adviser or sponsor.\n\n**Foreign-delivery limits:** Delivery may be postponed only for foreign investments when local holidays or settlement practices prevent timely delivery. It must occur as soon as practicable, and within 15 days.","ttft_ms":7298,"type":"result","duration_ms":10266,"uuid":"4eb08fc5-de0a-4ffc-a8ea-d19051915356","ttft_stream_ms":1286,"time_to_request_ms":76,"first_content_frame_ms":1286,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
